{{- /*
Resolve the model id an agent profile should carry, from its category rather than a hand-picked
band. Call with: (dict "root" . "harness" "<model_bands key>" "agent" "<agent_bindings key>").

The three-hop lookup is the whole point of the split registry: the profile names only itself, the
portable agent_bindings/agent_categories tables decide which band that job needs, and model_bands
decides what the band costs on this harness. A `counter`-family category takes the harness's
cross-family refuter when it has one; harnesses without one fall through to the primary max pick,
which is the degraded refutation the controller has to report.
*/ -}}
{{- $root := .root -}}
{{- $category := index $root.agent_bindings .agent -}}
{{- $spec := index $root.agent_categories $category -}}
{{- $pick := index (index $root.model_bands .harness) $spec.band -}}
{{- if and (eq $spec.family "counter") (hasKey $pick "counter") -}}
{{- $pick = $pick.counter -}}
{{- end -}}
{{- $pick.model -}}
